<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets warrants on China concept stock basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on China concept stock basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Thursday it proposed to issue 75 million American-style call warrants on a basket of China concept stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p>  New World Infrastructure Ltd	  0.45 shares</p>
<p>  Shanghai Industrial Holdings Ltd    0.5  shares</p>
<p>  CITIC Pacific Ltd			 0.25 shares</p>
<p>  China Resources Beijing Land Ltd    1    share</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$28.242    PREMIUM	 10.43 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.845     GEARING	 3.93X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  14.NOV.97    PAYDATE	 28.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  40,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$33.225    LISTING DATE  05.DEC.96</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL DELIVERY OR CASH AT ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
